Model weights are licensed separately from the code
---------------------------------------------------

Depth-Anything-V2 releases its Small model under Apache-2.0 and its Base, Large and Giant
models under CC-BY-NC-4.0. This work uses the ViT-Large depth model, so the Depth-Anything-V2
weights it loads are CC-BY-NC-4.0, that is, non-commercial.

No Depth-Anything-V2 weights are redistributed here. They are downloaded by the user from
the official repository.

A trained checkpoint of this work contains the Depth-Anything-V2 ViT-Large parameters, so
that checkpoint inherits the CC-BY-NC-4.0 restriction even though this source code does
not. The Apache-2.0 licence above applies to the code in this repository, not to any
checkpoint distributed alongside it.

